# 21. Final Pattern Recognition Cheat Sheet

```text
Question says "all nodes level by level"
→ Store every node in a level list

Question says "largest in each row"
→ Maintain max for each level

Question says "average of each level"
→ Maintain sum and divide by levelSize

Question says "right-side view"
→ Take the last node: i == levelSize - 1

Question says "left-side view"
→ Take the first node: i == 0

Question says "minimum depth"
→ Return when the first leaf is found

Question says "zigzag"
→ Change insertion direction after every level

Question says "connect same-level nodes"
→ Track the previous node
```

